  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Per NIST SP 800-86 Section 3.1, digital evidence admissibility requires write-blocking devices to prevent modification, an unbroken chain of custody, and thorough documentation of all forensic procedures. These practices collectively ensure evidence integrity for litigation.
