  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): The CCPA, as amended by the CPRA (California Civil Code Section 1798.120), grants consumers the right to opt out of the sale or sharing of their personal information. Businesses must provide a clear "Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information" link on their website.
