UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under HIPAA (45 CFR Section 164.502(e)), covered entities must execute a business associate agreement (BAA) with any third party that creates, receives, maintains, or transmits PHI on their behalf. The BAA must specify permitted uses and disclosures and require appropriate safeguards.
